        "mechanics_understanding": "Each turn you choose a movement action (e.g., MOVE_NORTH/SOUTH/EAST/WEST). If you try to move into a wall, the move is blocked and your position doesn\u2019t change. As you move, stepping on modifier tiles changes your carried piece: shape modifiers cycle the piece\u2019s shape, color modifiers cycle its color, and rotation modifiers rotate it 90\u00b0 clockwise. A goal becomes \u201cactivated\u201d when your current piece matches its requirements; you must then step onto that goal cell to complete it. Every action costs stamina; running out of stamina costs a life, and losing all lives ends the game."
